description = "Module S2 (uses S1): path types over the De Morgan interval — dependent paths PathP, path abstraction and application with boundary computation, typed NbE with eta for functions and paths, bidirectional checking, and the definitional path algebra (symmetry involution, ap functoriality, function extensionality, connection squares)"

